        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(ZT Systems), where we retained certain intellectual property and employees associated with the design operations (ZT Design Business).",
        "start_character": 8999,
        "end_character": 9134
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Beginning in the first quarter of fiscal year 2025, we combined the Client and Gaming segments into one reportable segment to align with how we manage our business.",
        "start_character": 10879,
        "end_character": 11043
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For these products, we either sell directly to our customers or through a network of distributors and OEM partners.",
        "start_character": 32603,
        "end_character": 32718
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In October 2025, we sold the ZT data center infrastructure manufacturing business (ZT Manufacturing Business) to Sanmina Corporation (Sanmina).",
        "start_character": 9306,
        "end_character": 9449
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have cooperative advertising and marketing programs with customers and third parties, including market development programs, pursuant to which we may provide product information, training, marketing materials and funds.",
        "start_character": 31044,
        "end_character": 31279
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we leverage our core IP, including graphics and processing technologies, to develop semi-custom solutions deeply co-engineered with our customers, which has enabled many of today’s leading gaming consoles and handheld gaming products.",
        "start_character": 19675,
        "end_character": 19922
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also employ application engineers to assist our customers in designing, testing and qualifying system designs that incorporate our products.",
        "start_character": 33015,
        "end_character": 33158
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also focus on software as part of the development of our products, including design automation tools for hardware, embedded software, AI stack, and optimized software tools and libraries that extend the reach of our platforms to software and AI developers.",
        "start_character": 41094,
        "end_character": 41353
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer data center rack-scale platform designs that incorporate AMD data center products to meet the growing performance demands of AI supercomputers and machine learning workloads.",
        "start_character": 5634,
        "end_character": 5822
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also developing a network of Value Added Resellers (VARs) and Integrated Solution Vendors (ISVs) for our Alveo products.",
        "start_character": 32719,
        "end_character": 32846
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our commitment to customer service and design support improves our customers’ time to market and fosters relationships that encourage customers to use the next generation of our products.",
        "start_character": 33159,
        "end_character": 33362
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000002488-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000002488-26-000018-247b08e661e15f3c",
        "accession_number": "0000002488-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct product and system R&D activities for our products in the United States with additional design and development engineering teams located in various countries who undertake specific activities at the direction of our U.S.",
